{"about_the_game":"<strong>Grab your wooden sword and walkie-talkie. Traverse Spacetime. Face the Essence of Evil.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/8e0478e6847af82c052ecd87e4b4fab6.avif?t=1765918660\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br><strong>A GAME ABOUT GOOD AND EVIL</strong><br><br>You Play as Davus, a 12 years old boy who must survive a Journey in a world filled with strange happenings and Evil manifestations. <br>Only you can find the Evil Presence responsible for bringing Panic to his Hometown.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br><strong> \u2022 The Walkie Talkie - </strong>   A mysterious device with magic properties. It looks an ordinary object, but there is something special about it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/865b6224b623d2fc794c44655c6bc1ea.poster.avif?t=1765918660\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/865b6224b623d2fc794c44655c6bc1ea.webm?t=1765918660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/865b6224b623d2fc794c44655c6bc1ea.mp4?t=1765918660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong> \u2022 Jump to explore - </strong>  Climb up platforms and mountain peaks in search of new destinations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a52a6023fa6801041de865e3f79b93b2.poster.avif?t=1765918660\" width=606 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069190/extras/a52a6023fa6801041de865e3f79b93b2.webm?t=1765918660\" type=\"video/webm; co